{"id":"teoria","lemma":"teoria","pos":"noun","rank":1092,"glosses":["theory (coherent set of statements attempting to explain observed phenomena)","theory (unproven conjecture)","theory (underlying principles as opposed to practice)"],"ipa":"/te.oˈɾi.ɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-teoria.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-teoria.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"teorias"},"examples":[{"text":"Eu tenho uma teoria.","en":"I have a theory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/491029","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Você tem uma teoria?","en":"Do you have a theory?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Não quero ouvir suas teorias.","en":"I don't want to hear your theories.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to hear"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null]},{"text":"Há uma teoria que explica isso.","en":"There's a theory that explains that.","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to explain","l":"explicar"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Sua teoria é difícil de entender.","en":"His theory is difficult to understand.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"difficult"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to understand"}]}]}